+  absolute before the next section - the onClose sequence plus the G90 a
+  mid-program home needs). Siemens 840D `M1` / `M0`, home `G0 G53 Z0`
+  then `G0 G53 X0 Y0` (machine coordinates, its onClose law). Fanuc Lathe
